config SND_INTEL8X0
    tristate "Intel ICH AC97 playback"
    depends on SND
    default y
    help
      Native legacy OSS playback for Intel 8086:2415 AC97 controllers.
      With M, build ac97.ko for this kernel. Open OSS descriptions pin the
      provider; unload requires acknowledged STOP and disabled bus mastering.
